至方與，（周市來攻方與）未戰。陳王使魏人周市略地。周市使人謂雍齒曰：「豐，故梁徙也。今魏地已定者數十城。齒今下魏，魏以齒為侯守豐。不下，且屠豐。」雍齒雅不欲屬沛公，及魏招之，即反為魏守豐。沛公引兵攻豐，不能取。沛公病，還之沛。沛公怨雍齒與豐子弟叛之，聞東陽甯君、秦嘉立景駒為假王，在留，乃往從之，欲請兵以攻豐。是時秦將章邯從陳，別將司馬夷將兵北定楚地，屠相，至碭。東陽甯君、沛公引兵西，與戰蕭西，不利。還收兵聚留，引兵攻碭，三日乃取碭。因收碭兵，得五六千人。攻下邑，拔之。還軍豐。聞項梁在薛，從騎百餘往見之。項梁益沛公卒五千人，五大夫將十人。沛公還，引兵攻豐。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"秦二世","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"pom_ycp_ha5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"周章","kind":"person","person_id":"idu_gor_8a1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"項氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0037","start":37,"end":42,"surface":"秦泗川監平","kind":"person","person_id":"s0b_5z2_duo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"雍齒","kind":"person","person_id":"q2q_a6e_9hs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0068","start":68,"end":72,"surface":"泗州守壯","kind":"person","person_id":"l6d_hvp_ot3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"左司馬","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0086","start":86,"end":90,"surface":"泗川守壯","kind":"person","person_id":"l6d_hvp_ot3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m011-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"