，虜秦候一人。秦將章邯破殺項梁也，沛公與項羽引而東。楚懷王以沛公為碭郡長，將碭郡兵。於是乃封參為執帛，號曰建成君。遷為戚公，屬碭郡。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"參","kind":"person","person_id":"37j_16p_7n8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"秦監公","kind":"person","person_id":"97z_1s7_oq1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"泗水守","kind":"person","person_id":"h8w_d3k_5bf","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"依本段單指官員、各一人或後相對話辨認；未名不補姓名，不與同官稱者全域合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0084","start":84,"end":88,"surface":"秦司馬夷","kind":"person","person_id":"m8o_g61_go9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"4jv_qte_5p4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"4jv_qte_5p4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"李由","kind":"person","person_id":"49g_7az_e4i_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0179","start":179,"end":181,"surface":"李由","kind":"person","person_id":"49g_7az_e4i_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0183","start":183,"end":187,"surface":"秦候一人","kind":"person","person_id":"6cr_o5c_vx8","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"依本段單指官員、各一人或後相對話辨認；未名不補姓名，不與同官稱者全域合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0190","start":190,"end":192,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"4jv_qte_5p4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0194","start":194,"end":196,"surface":"項梁","kind":"person","person_id":"5xt_rg8_7zs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0198","start":198,"end":200,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0201","start":201,"end":203,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"s5o_lxl_fqe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0207","start":207,"end":210,"surface":"楚懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"hrm_lw1_f9d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0211","start":211,"end":213,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m002-0227","start":227,"end":228,"surface":"參","kind":"person","person_id":"37j_16p_7n8","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","book_id":"b-shiji-054","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-054-cao"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p002","text":"初從高祖起豐，攻下沛。高祖為沛公，以噲為舍人。從攻胡陵、方與，還守豐，擊泗水監豐下，破之。復東定沛，破泗水守薛西。與司馬夷戰碭東，卻敵，斬首十五級，賜爵國大夫。常從，沛公擊章邯軍濮陽，攻城先登，斬首二十三級，賜爵列大夫。復常從，從攻城陽，先登。下戶牖，破李由軍，斬首十六級，賜上閒爵。從攻圍東郡守尉於成武，卻敵，斬首十四級，捕虜十一人，賜爵五大夫。從擊秦軍，出亳南。河閒守軍於杠里，破之。擊破趙賁軍開封北，以卻敵先登，斬候一人，首六十八級，捕虜二十七人，賜爵卿。從攻破楊熊軍於曲遇。攻宛陵，先登，斬首八級，捕虜四十四人，賜爵封號賢成君。從攻長社、轘轅，絕河津，東攻秦軍於尸，南攻秦軍於犨。破南陽守齮於陽城。東攻宛城，先登。西至酈，以卻敵，斬首二十四級，捕虜四十人，賜重封。攻武關，至霸上，斬都尉一人，首十級，捕虜百四十六人，降卒二千九百人。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m002-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m002-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m002-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-